{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB節目《女神配對計劃 2》最新一集超震撼！已被淘汰的吳俊峰（Mark）竟與陳若思（Amber）上演一幕車廂浪漫觀星約會，氣氛曖昧之際，Mark突然剖白內心，親揭一段痛苦的愛情陰影，更道出參加節目的真正原因，究竟他經歷過甚麼，令他講到眼濕濕？\n</p>\n<h2>Mark車廂觀星突變深情 浪漫約會剖白內心</h2>\n<p>在本周日（15日）播出的節目中，雖然Mark已被淘汰，但節目組依然保留了他與Amber的單對單「觀星車約會」。根據官方預告，Amber與Mark寫意地躺在車中觀星，Amber更大方露出「腳板仔」，率性又可愛。一直被指「零戀綜Feel」的Mark，在車上竟向Amber連環發放「愛的眼神」，望落既深情又深邃，場面超曖昧！Amber更坦言，第一輪收到三個心動吊墜時，曾懷疑Mark是第三個對她有意思的人，可惜因Mark「出動次數」太多而卻步，二人不禁感嘆總是緣慳一面，永遠只差「一點點」。</p>\n<h2>Mark首談愛情陰影「同Ex成日嗌交」</h2>\n<p>在浪漫氣氛下，Mark終於打開天窗說亮話，向Amber道出自己參賽以來，予人感覺只顧玩樂的背後真相，更首度剖白自己的「愛情陰影」。他感性地說：「其實我覺得自己唔係好適合拍拖，我希望下一次嗰個人係我結婚嘅對象」、「我真係好希望Meet到一個完全可以好舒服傾偈，唔會再嗌交嘅一個人」。他更沉重憶述與前度的關係：「我同我Ex成日嗌交，我哋嘗試去磨合，當我去遷就佢就我委屈，我委屈完我講，講完嗌交，之後到佢遷就我，到佢委屈。」一番話道出不少情侶的痛處。雖然緣盡節目，但Mark臨走前仍關心Amber的感情選擇，盡顯風度。</p>\n<h2>網民睇完預告勁心痛「原來係深情男」</h2>\n<p>預告片段一出，隨即引發網民熱烈討論，不少人對Mark的深情剖白大感意外，更表示對他完全改觀。網民紛紛留言力撐：「原來Mark唔係玩玩下，係有故事嘅男人！」、「聽到佢講同ex嗌交嗰度好有共鳴，遷就真係好辛苦」、「Amber走寶啦！咁深情嘅男仔去邊度搵？」、「睇到佢愛的眼神，真係好sad，明明差一點點…」、「支持Mark！希望佢現實中搵到個好女仔！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_6333724216af5644bcfe34.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 吳俊峰 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_6333724216af5644bcfe34.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_16877732736af5645e1d601.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 吳俊峰 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_16877732736af5645e1d601.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_4508398166af56461ec371.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 吳俊峰 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_4508398166af56461ec371.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_17875271326af56465cdf12.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_17875271326af56465cdf12.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_12723750366af5646db0630.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 吳俊峰 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_12723750366af5646db0630.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/25_1625383606af56477ba8ae.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 吳俊峰 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/25_1625383606af56477ba8ae.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/26_392508486af5647b42666.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 吳俊峰 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/26_392508486af5647b42666.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/27_9241003676af5647eeba24.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/27_9241003676af5647eeba24.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/32_13011908786af564922a3fc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/32_13011908786af564922a3fc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/35_15101634196af564996f720.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 吳俊峰 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/35_15101634196af564996f720.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/36_12248132026af5649d19425.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 吳俊峰 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/36_12248132026af5649d19425.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T07:43:59.215829+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1159,"images":11,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T07:30:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T08:57:24.118860+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T07:37:23.722175+00:00","content_hash":"05cadedc795e395576c7cba3dbd8ee0d99e20a1d3eb976083fa5660f47ec3d78","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}